    %% =========================

    Auth --> Sessions
    Cart --> Redis
    Catalog --> Redis
    Coupons --> Redis
    API --> RateLimit
    Orders --> Queue

    %% =========================
    %% DATABASE
    %% =========================

    Auth --> MySQL
    Catalog --> MySQL
    Inventory --> MySQL
    Cart --> MySQL
    Checkout --> MySQL
    Orders --> MySQL
    Coupons --> MySQL
    Users --> MySQL
    Reports --> Replica

    MySQL --> Replica

    %% =========================
